flowchart TD
  A[Firm signs up] --> B[Verify email and enrol MFA]
  B --> C[Firm profile and services]
  C --> D{Tranche 2 applies?}
  D -- No --> D1[Show guidance and keep account]
  D -- Yes --> E[Nominate AMLCO and invite team]
  E --> F[Program Builder interview]
  F --> G[Agent drafts program with citations]
  G --> H[AMLCO edits]
  H --> I{Owner or Senior Manager approves?}
  I -- No --> H
  I -- Yes --> J[Program v1 locked and exported]
  J --> K[Staff creates new client]
  K --> L[Upload ID and capture beneficial owners]
  L --> M[OCR extracts fields, staff confirms]
  M --> N[Sanctions and PEP screening]
  N --> O{Possible match?}
  O -- Yes --> P[AMLCO reviews match]
  P --> Q{True match?}
  Q -- Yes --> R[Decline client and consider SMR]
  Q -- No --> S[Mark false positive]
  O -- No --> S
  S --> T[Rule engine scores risk]
  T --> U{High risk?}
  U -- Yes --> V[Enhanced due diligence]
  V --> W{Second person approves?}
  W -- No --> R
  W -- Yes --> X[Client approved]
  U -- No --> X
  X --> Y[Set review date by risk]
  Y --> Z[Nightly re-screening and reminders]
  Z --> N
  R --> AA[Audit log entry]
  X --> AA
  AA --> AB[Reports and regulator pack]
